    "name":  "Flicker Free Driver for 220V Self-Rectifying LED Strip SMD IP65 | 10mm | 250W MAX.",
    "reference":  "91378-SMD",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eOptimize your LED installations with this \u003cstrong\u003eFlicker Free Driver, designed to eliminate flicker\u003c/strong\u003e and improve visual comfort \u003cstrong\u003ein self-rectifying 220V LED \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003eSMD\u003c/b\u003e strips with 10mm width (PCB 8mm). Offers up to 250W power, IP44 protection, power factor \u0026gt;0.95.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eFlicker Free Driver for Self-Rectifying 220V SMD LED Strip IP65 | 10mm | 250W MAX.\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet the very best performance and durability from your lighting installations with this \u003cstrong\u003eprofessional Flicker Free Driver\u003c/strong\u003e, designed specifically for self-rectifying \u003cstrong\u003e220V\u003c/strong\u003e SMD\u0026nbsp;LED strips with a standard width of \u003cstrong\u003e10mm (8mm PCB)\u003c/strong\u003e. This advanced LED controller offers a high-performance solution for demanding projects that require \u003cstrong\u003econtinuous, stable and flicker-free lighting\u003c/strong\u003e, reducing visual fatigue and improving the lighting experience in all kinds of environments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat does \"self-rectifying\" mean?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt means that the \u003cstrong\u003estrip internally incorporates a rectification system\u003c/strong\u003e (normally a bridge rectifier and/or small capacitors) that converts \u003cstrong\u003ealternating current (AC)\u003c/strong\u003e into \u003cstrong\u003edirect current (DC)\u003c/strong\u003e, which is what LEDs need in order to work. That is why it is called \"self-rectifying\": \u003cstrong\u003eit converts the current itself\u003c/strong\u003e, with no need for an external driver or power supply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey technical specifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum power:\u003c/strong\u003e up to \u003cstrong\u003e250W\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for long runs of LED strip.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput voltage:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eAC220V – 240V\u003c/strong\u003e, compatible with standard electrical networks.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput voltage:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eDC265V\u003c/strong\u003e, matched to self-rectifying LED strips.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e SMD\u0026nbsp;LED strips of \u003cstrong\u003e10mm width\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e8mm\u003c/strong\u003e PCB.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIP44 protection:\u003c/strong\u003e Suitable for indoor use and areas with moderate humidity.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePower factor:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026gt;0.95\u003c/strong\u003e, high energy efficiency and lower consumption.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlicker-Free technology:\u003c/strong\u003e eliminates the imperceptible flicker that can cause eye strain, headaches or visual discomfort.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdeal applications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional spaces:\u003c/strong\u003e offices, studios, medical or design practices where exposure to light is prolonged and constant.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCommercial areas:\u003c/strong\u003e display cabinets, retail stores, shopping centres or restaurants where quality lighting improves the customer experience.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDecorative projects:\u003c/strong\u003e architectural installations, indoor or covered outdoor lighting, where a clean look free of visual disturbance is required.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDemanding residential use:\u003c/strong\u003e ideal for homes seeking comfortable, modern lighting without eye strain in reading areas, kitchens or living rooms.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey benefits:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImproves visual health\u003c/strong\u003e by eliminating the invisible flicker common in conventional drivers.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConsistent performance\u003c/strong\u003e even in installations subject to intensive use.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh energy efficiency\u003c/strong\u003e, reducing the impact on the electricity bill.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUniversal compatibility\u003c/strong\u003e with self-rectifying 220V SMD\u0026nbsp;LED strips, making it easy to integrate into new or existing installations.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003e250W Flicker Free LED Driver\u003c/strong\u003e is the professional choice for those seeking \u003cstrong\u003elighting quality, efficiency and durability\u003c/strong\u003e. Ideal for anyone who will not compromise on visual comfort or performance in their LED lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical datasheet for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
